WEBVTT

01:30.450 --> 01:34.900
[The Unclouded Soul]

01:35.250 --> 01:37.830
[Episode 37]

01:52.400 --> 01:53.590
Qiong Qi Clan is actually

01:53.590 --> 01:55.150
so weak and lame without the sun.

01:55.150 --> 01:56.479
Check out on the inside.

02:11.310 --> 02:11.870
It's an ambush!

02:11.870 --> 02:12.400
Retreat!

02:38.000 --> 02:39.530
I've waited so long for you.

03:11.400 --> 03:12.200
These weapons

03:12.760 --> 03:13.890
are mostly ordinary

03:14.240 --> 03:15.800
and mixed with items stolen from

03:15.800 --> 03:18.060
mountain demons and the Lightning Clan.

03:18.120 --> 03:19.240
Based on these alone,

03:19.240 --> 03:20.810
it's difficult to determine

03:20.810 --> 03:22.410
the attackers' identities.

03:26.520 --> 03:27.670
Why are you looking at me?

03:27.670 --> 03:28.240
What?

03:28.560 --> 03:29.690
Is that not allowed?

03:33.390 --> 03:35.360
Ao Hen's very presence at this moment

03:35.360 --> 03:37.150
proves he has nothing to do with this,

03:37.150 --> 03:39.750
and that he's ready to help us
find the culprit.

03:40.470 --> 03:41.370
That's right.

03:41.560 --> 03:43.190
If the attack had been Ao Hen's doing,

03:43.190 --> 03:43.850
he would've

03:43.870 --> 03:45.590
either completely concealed himself,

03:45.590 --> 03:46.079
or

03:46.190 --> 03:47.590
shown his face instead of

03:47.630 --> 03:50.630
bothering wearing this mask,
given his temperament.

03:50.840 --> 03:52.840
By putting on this mask,

03:53.030 --> 03:55.290
the culprit was basically doing this...

03:59.590 --> 04:00.390
Hey!

04:00.560 --> 04:01.740
Attention!

04:01.870 --> 04:03.310
I'm definitely not Teng She!

04:03.310 --> 04:04.240
I'm not Teng She.

04:05.000 --> 04:05.840
You can't see me.

04:05.840 --> 04:06.560
I'm invisible.

04:06.560 --> 04:07.760
You just can't see me.

04:07.840 --> 04:08.840
You can't see...

04:09.560 --> 04:11.220
Why are you all defending him?

04:12.400 --> 04:14.470
Because when your clan was attacked
yesterday,

04:14.470 --> 04:16.040
the three of us were together.

04:16.040 --> 04:17.190
Ao Hen never left.

04:20.839 --> 04:22.240
What were you guys doing?

04:22.630 --> 04:23.830
We were... drinking!

04:29.210 --> 04:31.350
Slaughter has happened to every clan.

04:31.380 --> 04:32.780
It's known to all demons.

04:33.630 --> 04:35.120
If Ao Hen were innocent,

04:35.140 --> 04:37.159
he should've come forward to explain.

04:37.159 --> 04:37.990
Don't tell me

04:38.020 --> 04:39.880
you never knew those atrocities!

04:40.310 --> 04:41.950
I don't owe anyone any explanation

04:41.950 --> 04:42.950
for whatever I do.

04:43.350 --> 04:43.750
You...

04:43.770 --> 04:45.800
Ao Hen was concentrating
on his cultivation previously,

04:45.800 --> 04:47.950
so he really didn't know those incidents.

04:47.950 --> 04:48.600
Thank you.

04:48.720 --> 04:49.380
No worries.

04:52.320 --> 04:53.850
How very polite of you guys.

04:58.840 --> 05:00.560
I have some dragon bells here.

05:01.000 --> 05:02.660
When one of them is rung,

05:03.040 --> 05:03.900
all the others,

05:03.900 --> 05:05.310
however far apart they are,

05:05.310 --> 05:07.160
will sound and resonate promptly.

05:07.160 --> 05:09.090
Should anyone encounter an enemy,

05:10.000 --> 05:10.950
just ring the dragon bell,

05:10.950 --> 05:12.720
and the rest of us will come help.

05:12.720 --> 05:13.240
Agreed?

05:15.850 --> 05:16.310
Agreed.

05:18.300 --> 05:18.760
Agreed.

05:24.480 --> 05:25.520
During our wedding,

05:25.520 --> 05:26.400
we will need to

05:26.600 --> 05:27.520
honor our ancestors

05:27.520 --> 05:28.820
and bow to heaven and earth

05:28.820 --> 05:30.620
while dressed in proper attire.

05:30.850 --> 05:32.210
I invited you over today

05:32.360 --> 05:33.930
so you could try on your wedding gown.

05:33.930 --> 05:35.070
If there's any problem,

05:35.070 --> 05:36.730
we'll have it altered in time.

05:40.159 --> 05:40.740
Hong Ye!

05:41.190 --> 05:42.560
I showed up uninvited.

05:42.750 --> 05:43.810
Would you mind?

05:43.950 --> 05:44.750
Of course not.

05:47.000 --> 05:48.140
He insisted on tagging along

05:48.140 --> 05:50.200
upon learning that I was coming here.

05:50.390 --> 05:51.020
That said,

05:51.070 --> 05:53.190
Long Yu did contribute significantly

05:53.190 --> 05:54.680
to persuading all branches

05:54.680 --> 05:55.740
of the Dragon Clan.

05:56.920 --> 05:57.560
Then I owe

05:57.640 --> 05:58.900
many thanks to Long Yu.

06:02.310 --> 06:04.510
The Dragon Lord is delighted
just at the sight of you.

06:04.510 --> 06:07.310
So I realized I must help the two of you
get married.

06:10.070 --> 06:11.870
People don't seem afraid anymore

06:11.870 --> 06:13.930
when they see me and Long Yu this time.

06:14.070 --> 06:15.990
They've all thought it through.

06:16.270 --> 06:17.270
Just like humans,

06:17.410 --> 06:19.070
there are good and bad demons.

06:41.270 --> 06:42.200
Go try on the dress.

06:42.200 --> 06:43.659
We'll be waiting outside.

06:43.820 --> 06:44.260
Sure.

06:48.909 --> 06:49.430
Let's go.

06:49.430 --> 06:49.830
Yes.

06:55.990 --> 06:57.990
I was the architect of your romance.

06:58.440 --> 07:00.040
How are you going to thank me?

07:01.180 --> 07:02.180
This way, please.

07:05.560 --> 07:07.620
Please try on the dress, Dragon Lord.

07:19.800 --> 07:21.120
I've noticed that Xiao Yao looks

07:21.120 --> 07:22.310
a bit unwell today.

07:23.360 --> 07:25.130
Is she still bothered by the hunt

07:25.130 --> 07:25.990
for Ao Hen Clan?

07:27.480 --> 07:28.880
Ao Hen isn't the culprit.

07:28.930 --> 07:29.610
Then who is?

07:30.730 --> 07:31.950
It's not clear yet.

07:32.470 --> 07:33.400
But don't worry.

07:33.800 --> 07:35.000
Before your wedding,

07:35.000 --> 07:37.860
the Dragon Lord will surely catch
the real culprit.

07:43.560 --> 07:44.240
Your Majesty,

07:44.240 --> 07:46.070
the Dragon Lord has put on the dress.

07:46.070 --> 07:46.870
You may leave.

07:48.360 --> 07:49.000
I'll go take a look.

07:49.000 --> 07:49.430
Enjoy the feast.

07:49.430 --> 07:49.750
Yes.

08:31.830 --> 08:32.690
Why stare at me?

08:33.440 --> 08:34.970
I just can't take my eyes off

08:35.720 --> 08:37.850
the most beautiful bride in the world.

09:22.680 --> 09:24.140
What did you do to Xiao Yao?

09:26.240 --> 09:27.670
I only had the illusion beast

09:27.670 --> 09:29.600
record her appearance and breath.

09:30.520 --> 09:33.120
Whoever wears this wedding dress
in the future

09:33.160 --> 09:35.100
will morph into the Dragon Lord.

09:37.290 --> 09:38.750
After Xiao Yao marries me,

09:39.150 --> 09:41.390
she'll protect humans with all her might.

09:41.390 --> 09:42.990
I genuinely want to marry her

09:43.270 --> 09:44.150
only for who she is

09:44.150 --> 09:45.400
and nothing else.

09:46.550 --> 09:47.630
We've already benefited

09:47.630 --> 09:48.960
tremendously from her.

09:49.000 --> 09:50.680
How can we despicably use her again?

09:50.680 --> 09:51.480
Your Majesty,

09:52.750 --> 09:53.910
I beg to disagree.

09:55.050 --> 09:56.360
She is the Dragon Lord.

09:57.550 --> 09:59.580
If she knows what we've done,

10:00.480 --> 10:02.120
will she still marry you?

10:03.050 --> 10:05.450
Will she let us gather
all the demon pearls?

10:06.910 --> 10:08.400
That Water Dragon also said

10:08.400 --> 10:09.200
before the wedding,

10:09.200 --> 10:12.860
the Azure Dragon would definitely
end the current chaotic world.

10:13.080 --> 10:13.880
Your Majesty,

10:14.150 --> 10:15.030
we must act now,

10:15.220 --> 10:17.080
or all our efforts will be in vain.

10:17.550 --> 10:20.000
What's worse,
catastrophes will befall us humans.

10:20.000 --> 10:23.150
But if we find Yuli Spring
before the wedding,

10:23.750 --> 10:26.370
the world order will undergo
a fundamental change.

10:26.370 --> 10:28.370
Then everything will be different.

10:37.840 --> 10:39.540
If the human realm falls,

10:39.790 --> 10:41.790
will Your Majesty still get a chance

10:43.150 --> 10:44.680
to be on equal footing

10:45.200 --> 10:47.660
with the Dragon Lord, let alone marry her?

10:53.040 --> 10:55.500
Our only hope is pinned on
her wedding dress.

11:03.990 --> 11:05.920
Please reconsider, Your Majesty.

11:46.120 --> 11:46.790
Xiao Yao?

11:48.030 --> 11:48.480
You...

11:49.090 --> 11:51.390
I can't believe you'd come meet me
on your own accord.

11:51.390 --> 11:52.850
Aren't you happy about it?

11:53.670 --> 11:54.800
Of course I'm happy.

11:56.240 --> 11:57.170
It just seems...

11:57.480 --> 11:58.740
that something's off.

11:59.360 --> 12:00.200
Your dress...

12:03.150 --> 12:05.480
I'm here to tell you something.

12:05.650 --> 12:06.250
What is it?

12:07.400 --> 12:08.600
I'm getting married.

12:09.910 --> 12:10.630
You are?

12:10.950 --> 12:12.510
On the day of the next new moon,

12:12.510 --> 12:15.150
namely the first day of the eighth month
in human calendar,

12:15.150 --> 12:16.120
I hope to see you

12:16.520 --> 12:17.640
at my wedding

12:17.720 --> 12:19.190
with the Primordial Pearl

12:19.640 --> 12:21.370
and to receive your blessings.

12:21.840 --> 12:22.770
Who's the groom?

12:23.930 --> 12:25.460
Hong Ye, the human emperor.

12:26.310 --> 12:27.280
Hong Ye?

12:29.320 --> 12:30.780
You're serious about him?

12:31.370 --> 12:32.300
He's a human,

12:33.250 --> 12:35.480
and humans are the lowliest of creatures,

12:35.480 --> 12:36.480
while you are an Azure Dragon.

12:36.480 --> 12:38.480
-How can that inferior...
-Shut up!

12:46.120 --> 12:46.790
Qiong Qi,

12:47.870 --> 12:49.950
we've known each other since childhood.

12:49.950 --> 12:50.860
In my heart,

12:51.200 --> 12:52.870
I consider you my family.

12:53.390 --> 12:54.030
I know

12:54.720 --> 12:56.130
you care for me

12:56.320 --> 12:57.120
and protect me

12:57.370 --> 12:58.630
like an older brother.

13:00.210 --> 13:02.140
Hong Ye and I are genuinely in love.

13:02.960 --> 13:03.870
I understand

13:03.930 --> 13:06.390
lots of demons will oppose
my union with him.

13:08.270 --> 13:10.090
Qiong Qi Clan is highly revered.

13:10.120 --> 13:11.450
I believe your presence

13:11.630 --> 13:13.670
will subdue many voices of dissent.

13:30.430 --> 13:32.630
But if even you don't come to support me,

13:33.600 --> 13:35.730
then I'll be truly alone and helpless.

13:45.000 --> 13:45.720
Fine.

13:50.750 --> 13:52.360
Anyway, as a human, Hong Ye won't live

13:52.360 --> 13:53.690
for more than 100 years.

13:54.000 --> 13:54.750
I'll pretend

13:55.150 --> 13:56.810
that you're just off on a trip,

13:56.840 --> 13:57.840
and wait 100 years

13:58.130 --> 13:59.590
till you make a new choice.

14:00.450 --> 14:01.670
Then it's settled.

14:03.120 --> 14:03.890
Remember

14:04.480 --> 14:05.720
to attend my wedding with...

14:05.720 --> 14:06.980
The Primordial Pearl.

14:29.190 --> 14:30.390
I'll just take a peek.

14:32.810 --> 14:33.760
Only one glance.

14:49.480 --> 14:50.530
This is inappropriate.

14:50.530 --> 14:51.490
Avert my eyes.

14:51.670 --> 14:52.650
Avert my eyes.

15:06.350 --> 15:07.210
Yao.

15:10.030 --> 15:10.590
I...

15:10.610 --> 15:11.540
I'm sorry.

15:12.720 --> 15:14.050
I didn't mean to do that.

15:14.120 --> 15:14.630
Actually...

15:14.630 --> 15:16.000
I didn't see anything.

15:16.000 --> 15:17.130
I was just wondering

15:17.240 --> 15:18.480
if I could do anything

15:18.480 --> 15:20.880
to ease the heavy burden
on your shoulders.

15:21.720 --> 15:23.030
Please don't look at me that way.

15:23.030 --> 15:23.830
I'm scared.

15:24.240 --> 15:26.040
I was really just trying to help.

15:30.240 --> 15:30.980
However,

15:31.360 --> 15:32.760
what can you help me with?

15:35.240 --> 15:36.370
Take it for your use.

15:39.840 --> 15:41.150
Don't you only come to me

15:41.150 --> 15:43.270
when you need to borrow the Mist Pearl?

15:43.270 --> 15:44.550
Who are you looking for this time?

15:44.550 --> 15:45.280
Is it Hong Ye?

15:45.600 --> 15:46.120
Ao Hen?

15:46.320 --> 15:46.890
Or...

15:47.150 --> 15:48.080
Whoever is fine!

15:48.360 --> 15:49.020
Use it then.

15:50.910 --> 15:52.840
This time, I'm looking for nobody,

15:53.150 --> 15:54.010
but you.

15:56.840 --> 15:57.910
Me?

15:59.630 --> 16:01.430
This has never happened before.

16:02.320 --> 16:03.460
Just tell me

16:03.720 --> 16:05.080
what you need me to do.

16:05.080 --> 16:06.410
I promise to get it done.

16:06.630 --> 16:07.830
I'd like to invite you

16:08.000 --> 16:09.720
to my wedding in the human realm

16:09.720 --> 16:11.380
on the day of the next new moon.

16:18.490 --> 16:20.480
You're getting married so soon?

16:26.490 --> 16:27.520
Didn't you say

16:28.080 --> 16:29.750
you sincerely wished me

16:29.870 --> 16:31.480
all the best and sheer joy?

16:35.630 --> 16:36.360
Yes, I did.

16:37.840 --> 16:38.790
As long as

16:40.600 --> 16:42.070
Hong Ye treats you right,

16:43.750 --> 16:45.010
I'll do as you say, Yao.

16:48.120 --> 16:49.240
Hong Ye and I have been

16:49.240 --> 16:51.630
through a lot to get to
the point of marriage.

16:51.630 --> 16:52.960
The sacred relic of each clan

16:52.960 --> 16:55.420
can offer protection and bestow blessings.

16:57.520 --> 16:59.610
Would you bring the Mist Pearl

16:59.630 --> 17:02.100
to my wedding
on behalf of all vine serpents,

17:02.510 --> 17:04.440
so it can confer blessings upon me?

17:05.880 --> 17:06.599
Sure.

17:09.030 --> 17:09.790
I knew

17:09.790 --> 17:11.599
you had my best interests at heart.

17:11.599 --> 17:12.849
Then it's settled.

17:14.410 --> 17:15.130
By the way,

17:16.230 --> 17:18.520
would you please tell Ao Hen in my stead

17:19.270 --> 17:20.089
that

17:20.200 --> 17:22.550
he's also cordially invited to my wedding?

17:22.550 --> 17:24.680
Ask him to bring along the sacred relic

17:25.630 --> 17:28.760
of Ao Hen Clan,
if he still values my friendship with him.

17:28.790 --> 17:29.750
On my wedding day,

17:29.750 --> 17:31.550
I'd like to have a drink with him.

17:32.240 --> 17:32.750
Got it.

17:34.310 --> 17:35.590
I need to be somewhere else now.

17:35.590 --> 17:37.250
Thank you for doing me a favor.

17:37.920 --> 17:39.070
Don't forget the date

17:39.070 --> 17:40.440
is the first day of the eighth month

17:40.440 --> 17:41.500
in human calendar.

17:50.030 --> 17:50.760
Both Qiong Qi

17:51.400 --> 17:52.060
and Teng She

17:53.370 --> 17:54.500
have agreed to bring

17:55.200 --> 17:56.730
their pearls to my wedding.

17:57.480 --> 17:58.110
I guess...

17:59.110 --> 18:00.240
Ao Hen will come too.

18:02.480 --> 18:03.350
Great.

18:04.240 --> 18:06.070
We've already got the Earth Pearl
from the Mountain Demon Clan,

18:06.070 --> 18:07.270
the Thunder Pearl from the Lightning Clan,

18:07.270 --> 18:09.240
the Celestial Pearl from the Fox Clan,

18:09.240 --> 18:10.550
and the Wind Calming Pearl from Bi Fang.

18:10.550 --> 18:12.830
When we attain
Qiong Qi's Primordial Pearl,

18:12.830 --> 18:14.030
Teng She's Mist Pearl,

18:14.030 --> 18:15.830
and Ao Hen's Universe Pearl,

18:16.110 --> 18:16.910
Your Majesty,

18:17.230 --> 18:18.830
we'll need nothing more but—

18:19.590 --> 18:21.050
the Dragon Essence Pearl.

18:22.070 --> 18:22.870
Your Majesty,

18:23.760 --> 18:26.850
our long quest of pearls
is finally coming to an end.

18:32.090 --> 18:37.450
[Happiness]

18:38.090 --> 18:39.620
Under no circumstances...

18:41.780 --> 18:43.840
should any harm be caused to Xiao Yao.

18:45.640 --> 18:46.230
Got it.

19:04.640 --> 19:07.300
I was just wondering about
this familiar smell.

19:07.790 --> 19:09.720
It turns out you're really around.

19:10.480 --> 19:12.510
Given how much you enjoyed the food
last time,

19:12.510 --> 19:14.370
I thought I'd bring you some more.

19:16.160 --> 19:17.720
I'm beginning to understand

19:17.720 --> 19:18.680
why the Dragon Lord

19:18.680 --> 19:20.210
is determined to marry you.

19:21.550 --> 19:22.070
You...

19:22.440 --> 19:23.870
came from afar

19:24.550 --> 19:26.680
not just to bring me food, right?

19:27.160 --> 19:28.220
Do you need my help?

19:30.310 --> 19:31.510
I can't stop thinking

19:32.070 --> 19:33.600
that Xiao Yao must be making

19:33.960 --> 19:35.690
a big sacrifice by marrying me,

19:35.930 --> 19:37.590
though she never mentions it.

19:39.400 --> 19:41.260
Maybe I can somewhat make up for it

19:41.960 --> 19:43.560
with considerate gestures.

19:44.270 --> 19:45.400
The Dragon Lord certainly deserves

19:45.400 --> 19:46.270
the best and the most

19:46.270 --> 19:47.670
thoughtful gifts of all.

19:49.120 --> 19:49.920
You know what?

19:50.790 --> 19:52.120
After getting married,

19:52.680 --> 19:53.920
human women usually take

19:53.920 --> 19:55.480
their husbands' last names.

19:55.480 --> 19:57.250
But Xiao Yao will be an exception.

19:57.250 --> 19:58.450
After she marries me,

19:59.110 --> 20:01.450
I hope both demons and humans will still

20:01.750 --> 20:03.480
respect her as the Dragon Lord,

20:04.240 --> 20:07.160
instead of the human empress
bound by ties of affection.

20:07.160 --> 20:08.090
That's for sure.

20:10.680 --> 20:11.510
Therefore,

20:12.270 --> 20:13.590
I'm planning to make her

20:13.590 --> 20:14.920
a unique empress crown.

20:15.320 --> 20:16.920
I intend to search worldwide

20:17.160 --> 20:18.420
for treasures to craft

20:18.620 --> 20:21.190
a piece of jewelry similar to
the precious Dragon Essence Pearl

20:21.190 --> 20:22.920
and place it on top of the crown.

20:23.350 --> 20:24.210
It will not only

20:24.550 --> 20:26.110
demonstrate her eminence,

20:26.480 --> 20:27.340
but also show

20:27.590 --> 20:29.110
my sincerity to the dragon clan.

20:29.110 --> 20:30.170
That's a good idea.

20:31.880 --> 20:33.020
But no human

20:33.310 --> 20:34.790
has ever seen

20:35.010 --> 20:36.470
the Dragon Essence Pearl.

20:37.490 --> 20:38.320
How's that a problem?

20:38.320 --> 20:39.550
You can just ask the Dragon Lord

20:39.550 --> 20:40.750
to show you the pearl.

20:41.150 --> 20:42.720
But the crown won't be a surprise for her

20:42.720 --> 20:44.720
if she knows about it so soon, right?

20:48.110 --> 20:49.110
You're right.

20:49.270 --> 20:50.160
How about

20:51.030 --> 20:52.550
you sneak me into the Dragon Palace

20:52.550 --> 20:54.680
for a peek at the Dragon Essence Pearl?

20:56.860 --> 20:58.110
I'll just take one glance.

20:58.110 --> 20:59.110
Then I'll be gone.

20:59.200 --> 21:01.000
I swear not to cause you trouble.

21:04.480 --> 21:05.740
I suppose I can do that.

21:14.070 --> 21:15.200
Six chests of pearls.

21:15.200 --> 21:16.590
Twelve bolts of fine silk.

21:16.590 --> 21:18.790
Twenty-four boxes of garments
and twenty-four sets of jewelry.

21:18.790 --> 21:19.960
Conduct a thorough check.

21:19.960 --> 21:20.220
Yes.

21:20.240 --> 21:20.680
Yes.

21:24.030 --> 21:25.550
The coral doesn't look good enough.

21:25.550 --> 21:26.510
Replace it with a better piece.

21:26.510 --> 21:26.790
Yes.

21:27.830 --> 21:29.240
Everyone, be careful.

21:29.640 --> 21:30.790
No mistake is allowed

21:30.790 --> 21:33.030
in such trivial preparation work
for the Dragon Lord's wedding.

21:33.030 --> 21:33.720
Yes.

21:35.790 --> 21:38.050
I need to keep a closer eye on everything.

21:38.480 --> 21:39.510
Jade...

21:42.510 --> 21:43.590
You'll undergo a tribulation soon.

21:43.590 --> 21:44.750
Focus on your cultivation now.

21:44.750 --> 21:45.610
You shouldn't be bothered

21:45.610 --> 21:47.210
with these trivial matters.

21:47.790 --> 21:49.070
I just feel obligated to make

21:49.070 --> 21:51.350
everything perfect for you, Dragon Lord.

21:51.350 --> 21:52.440
To me, perfection is

21:52.440 --> 21:54.640
when you survive the tribulation
and attend my wedding

21:54.640 --> 21:55.830
as a winged dragon.

21:59.070 --> 21:59.870
Dragon Lord,

22:00.240 --> 22:02.270
if I make it through the tribulation,

22:02.270 --> 22:04.260
will you forgive me

22:04.790 --> 22:06.070
for all my wrongdoing?

22:06.790 --> 22:08.510
What kind of silly talk is that?

22:08.510 --> 22:10.440
Do you think I'd really be mad at you

22:10.480 --> 22:12.210
for our occasional bickering?

22:12.400 --> 22:13.370
Am I that petty

22:13.590 --> 22:14.620
in your eyes?

22:15.510 --> 22:16.570
No.

22:17.880 --> 22:19.140
I was overthinking it.

22:19.720 --> 22:21.240
I've prepared something for you.

22:21.240 --> 22:21.970
Come with me.

22:34.400 --> 22:35.790
This golden armor has been altered

22:35.790 --> 22:37.640
according to your measurements.

22:37.640 --> 22:38.590
You should wear it

22:38.590 --> 22:39.720
for your tribulation,

22:39.720 --> 22:40.980
as it'll ease the pain.

22:41.240 --> 22:42.050
No, I can't.

22:42.270 --> 22:43.480
This is a one-of-a-kind suit of armor

22:43.480 --> 22:44.510
exclusive to you, an Azure Dragon.

22:44.510 --> 22:45.440
How can I wear it?

22:45.830 --> 22:46.770
Why not?

22:47.030 --> 22:48.320
I'm waiting for the day

22:48.400 --> 22:49.960
when you become an Azure Dragon

22:49.960 --> 22:53.620
and take over my responsibility
of protecting all living beings.

22:54.880 --> 22:55.830
The Dragon Lord ordered

22:55.830 --> 22:58.200
to bring more spirit herbs
and shells for humans.

22:58.200 --> 22:58.580
Yes.

22:58.680 --> 22:59.070
Yes.

23:09.110 --> 23:10.270
Send the items to storage.

23:10.270 --> 23:10.550
Yes.

23:14.360 --> 23:16.090
Such premium luminous pearls.

23:16.590 --> 23:17.640
Where are they from?

23:17.640 --> 23:19.680
They're a tribute
from the Tiger Shark Clan

23:19.680 --> 23:21.310
for the Dragon Lord's wedding.

23:21.310 --> 23:22.650
Are they being sent to the Treasure House?

23:22.650 --> 23:23.310
Exactly.

23:24.110 --> 23:24.920
Let me do it for you.

23:24.920 --> 23:25.880
Go attend to other things.

23:25.880 --> 23:26.550
Hold them tight.

23:26.550 --> 23:27.410
Don't drop any.

23:27.720 --> 23:28.980
Sure thing. Off you go.

23:40.630 --> 23:41.400
Come over!

23:43.030 --> 23:43.500
Hold these.

23:43.500 --> 23:44.170
Follow me.

23:58.240 --> 24:00.170
Which is the Dragon Essence Pearl?

24:00.580 --> 24:01.240
Right here.

24:01.240 --> 24:01.700
Come on.

24:01.920 --> 24:02.520
Over here.

24:08.920 --> 24:09.710
This is...

24:10.320 --> 24:11.880
The sacred relic of the dragon clan.

24:11.880 --> 24:13.480
Only when it senses a dragon's breath

24:13.480 --> 24:14.740
will it reveal itself.

24:32.760 --> 24:34.090
Have you got a good look?

24:34.820 --> 24:35.870
Yes, I have.

24:35.890 --> 24:36.390
Great.

24:36.620 --> 24:37.620
Then let's leave.

24:41.210 --> 24:41.980
I'm sorry.

24:50.370 --> 24:51.500
What did you just do?

24:51.750 --> 24:52.860
Nothing.

24:54.880 --> 24:55.940
Alright, let's go.

24:56.510 --> 24:57.030
Wait.

24:58.480 --> 24:58.920
Hurry up.

24:58.920 --> 24:59.400
Go with me.

24:59.400 --> 24:59.980
Let's go.

25:02.680 --> 25:05.200
Someone's trying to steal
the Dragon Essence Pearl.

25:05.200 --> 25:06.020
How very bold.

25:06.400 --> 25:08.260
They won't be able to leave alive.

25:32.070 --> 25:33.470
All of you, exit the room.

25:37.920 --> 25:39.050
Nothing is missing.

25:41.200 --> 25:42.270
This is odd.

25:43.880 --> 25:44.640
Dragon Lord,

25:44.880 --> 25:46.960
Ao Hen and Teng She
are waiting in the hall.

25:46.960 --> 25:47.480
Yao,

25:48.400 --> 25:50.200
how is the Dragon Essence Pearl?

25:50.750 --> 25:52.140
It's safe and intact.

25:52.550 --> 25:53.610
Where is the thief?

25:53.960 --> 25:54.750
Where is he?

25:56.270 --> 25:56.750
Where?

26:00.400 --> 26:01.520
Where is the thief?

26:01.640 --> 26:03.170
The thief already ran away.

26:05.310 --> 26:07.170
Has your dowry been prepared yet?

26:07.920 --> 26:08.310
Yes.

26:09.110 --> 26:10.910
Quite a lot of treasures indeed.

26:12.830 --> 26:14.290
Could it be that your dowry

26:14.310 --> 26:16.120
has become someone's target?

26:18.200 --> 26:19.200
A false alarm though it was,

26:19.200 --> 26:21.130
you've all been brought here by it.

26:21.200 --> 26:22.460
Let me make this clear:

26:22.640 --> 26:23.720
all of you

26:23.750 --> 26:25.390
must attend my wedding.

26:25.720 --> 26:26.380
Otherwise,

26:26.590 --> 26:28.590
I won't be friends with you anymore.

26:28.720 --> 26:30.650
If I were a better fighter than you,

26:31.130 --> 26:33.990
I would definitely take you away
from your wedding.

26:34.200 --> 26:35.160
Don't worry, Yao.

26:35.160 --> 26:35.750
I...

26:36.400 --> 26:37.600
will surely be there.

26:40.440 --> 26:42.770
I'll also be there
with what you asked for.

26:44.770 --> 26:47.570
All I ask is for you to have a good time
at my wedding.

26:49.030 --> 26:50.430
Don't cause any trouble.

26:50.650 --> 26:53.040
If you do consider me a friend and family,

26:53.480 --> 26:55.080
then give me your blessings.

27:09.590 --> 27:10.790
That was a close call.

27:11.000 --> 27:12.440
Fortunately, they didn't spot us.

27:12.440 --> 27:13.030
Thank you

27:13.540 --> 27:14.870
for fulfilling my wish.

27:15.640 --> 27:16.660
To return my favor,

27:16.660 --> 27:18.400
just treat the Dragon Lord right.

27:18.400 --> 27:19.260
I look forward to seeing

27:19.260 --> 27:20.120
the empress crown

27:20.120 --> 27:21.920
of you own making at the wedding.

27:22.510 --> 27:22.960
Sure.

27:47.420 --> 27:49.050
[Next day of the new moon]

27:49.050 --> 27:50.690
[First day of the eighth month
in human calendar]

28:11.440 --> 28:12.270
Teng She,

28:13.070 --> 28:15.670
you're quite enthusiastic
about everything.

28:17.200 --> 28:18.920
I would definitely attend Yao's wedding,

28:18.920 --> 28:20.450
since I gave her my promise,

28:20.680 --> 28:22.260
unlike a certain demon

28:22.350 --> 28:23.630
who had no choice but to

28:23.720 --> 28:24.830
show up in the end

28:24.830 --> 28:26.440
after claiming he'd rather

28:26.750 --> 28:27.590
be beaten to death by Yao

28:27.590 --> 28:29.190
than let Hong Ye off the hook.

28:29.440 --> 28:31.040
If you hadn't stood in my way,

28:31.350 --> 28:33.110
Hong Ye wouldn't have lived
to see this day.

28:33.110 --> 28:33.570
Fine.

28:33.790 --> 28:35.260
Go catch him again now.

28:35.400 --> 28:36.070
But don't act crazy

28:36.070 --> 28:37.550
in front of me again when things blow up.

28:37.550 --> 28:38.650
Teng She, shut up.

28:39.000 --> 28:40.240
He wasted so much of my wine.

28:40.240 --> 28:41.300
With me being here,

28:41.350 --> 28:43.030
nobody will have the guts or the chance

28:43.030 --> 28:44.830
to force Xiao Yao to do anything!

28:45.000 --> 28:47.200
I just haven't criticized you, alright?

28:47.200 --> 28:48.600
You are the one who always

28:48.680 --> 28:50.480
pushes Yao into a fight with you.

28:52.000 --> 28:54.200
What a shabby wedding.

28:54.960 --> 28:57.510
If I had foreseen Xiao Yao had to make
such a big compromise,

28:57.510 --> 28:58.550
I would've told her

28:58.550 --> 29:00.200
my feelings for her a thousand years ago,

29:00.200 --> 29:02.330
so as to spare her from such suffering.

29:02.640 --> 29:03.800
You should be glad

29:04.000 --> 29:05.200
that you didn't do it.

29:05.920 --> 29:08.980
Otherwise, you would've lost her
a thousand years ago.

29:09.440 --> 29:11.630
Who are you to comment on my matters?

29:11.920 --> 29:13.920
Xiao Yao had nothing to do with you
in the first place.

29:13.920 --> 29:14.960
You were just delusional

29:14.960 --> 29:16.680
and pursuing her relentlessly.

29:16.680 --> 29:17.400
You silly

29:17.400 --> 29:18.680
simpleton.

29:19.270 --> 29:20.330
The chances for two

29:20.750 --> 29:22.880
to start a romance decrease with time.

29:23.680 --> 29:25.160
You've been around Yao the longest,

29:25.160 --> 29:26.880
which means you stand the least chance
of winning her over.

29:26.880 --> 29:28.270
You have a death wish or what?

29:28.270 --> 29:28.830
Enough!

29:31.790 --> 29:32.430
Anyway,

29:34.160 --> 29:35.720
Yao will be single again
in a hundred years.

29:35.720 --> 29:37.310
Let's have a fair competition

29:37.310 --> 29:38.970
for her a hundred years later.

29:39.270 --> 29:40.550
May the best man win.

29:42.200 --> 29:42.830
Agreed.

29:58.310 --> 30:00.230
After cultivating for a thousand years,

30:00.230 --> 30:02.630
I'm about to undergo another tribulation.

30:02.640 --> 30:04.830
I pray to you, all dragon ancestors,
for the luck

30:04.830 --> 30:06.310
to go through the tribulation

30:06.310 --> 30:07.970
and to become a winged dragon.

30:25.110 --> 30:26.790
May the heavens grant

30:27.000 --> 30:27.880
Long Zhi

30:27.880 --> 30:29.510
success in passing the tribulation

30:29.510 --> 30:31.170
and becoming a winged dragon.

30:31.480 --> 30:33.240
Grant her success
in passing the tribulation

30:33.240 --> 30:34.900
and becoming a winged dragon.

30:50.270 --> 30:51.000
How do you feel?

30:51.000 --> 30:52.830
With the support of the seniors' spirits,

30:52.830 --> 30:54.760
aren't you feeling energized now?

31:03.920 --> 31:04.850
Don't be afraid.

31:04.920 --> 31:06.720
We've prepared so long for this.

31:07.110 --> 31:09.440
I'm sure you'll survive the tribulation.

31:10.550 --> 31:11.080
I hope so.

31:15.900 --> 31:20.170
[Happiness]

31:32.590 --> 31:33.830
This is only a human wedding,

31:33.830 --> 31:36.290
yet it looks like a ceremony
to worship gods.

31:38.040 --> 31:40.000
You truly are my real friends.

31:40.090 --> 31:40.950
I knew

31:41.180 --> 31:42.260
you would all come.

31:43.440 --> 31:44.230
We all...

31:45.090 --> 31:46.930
want you to be happy, Yao.

31:47.920 --> 31:48.720
In the future,

31:49.230 --> 31:50.830
if Hong Ye ever upsets you,

31:51.240 --> 31:53.170
I'll cut him into a million pieces.

31:54.920 --> 31:55.570
Oh, right.

31:55.790 --> 31:56.720
Where is Hong Ye?

31:56.720 --> 31:58.250
How come he hasn't shown up?

31:59.200 --> 32:01.110
Humans observe their own customs.

32:01.110 --> 32:03.200
Women are respected, and men are honored.

32:03.200 --> 32:04.700
The groom will not appear

32:05.110 --> 32:06.640
until everything is ready.

32:08.200 --> 32:09.260
Let me be clear.

32:09.830 --> 32:11.740
I did promise you not to cause trouble,

32:11.740 --> 32:12.510
but only provided

32:12.510 --> 32:14.640
that Hong Ye wouldn't go out of bounds.

32:18.000 --> 32:19.450
We're already here.

32:19.550 --> 32:20.270
Let's all follow

32:20.270 --> 32:21.840
the human customs today.

32:22.750 --> 32:23.600
Let's go.

32:23.730 --> 32:24.190
Come on.

32:37.520 --> 32:39.400
Hong Ye and I are deeply grateful

32:39.680 --> 32:40.700
to be graced

32:40.830 --> 32:41.960
with your presence.

32:45.350 --> 32:47.080
Please give us your blessings.

33:52.880 --> 33:54.680
This is not demonic power at all.

33:55.200 --> 33:55.840
Xiao Yao,

33:56.110 --> 33:57.770
did you lay this ambush for us?

33:59.620 --> 34:01.190
Did you plan for all this?

34:03.050 --> 34:04.250
Did you also disguise

34:04.440 --> 34:05.840
as Ao Hen to slaughter

34:06.000 --> 34:07.090
other demon clans?

34:07.720 --> 34:08.770
You told me

34:08.920 --> 34:10.590
you would protect all living beings.

34:10.590 --> 34:11.909
Is that how you do it?

34:13.070 --> 34:13.630
Yao,

34:13.909 --> 34:15.320
does a thousand years of companionship

34:15.320 --> 34:18.120
really mean less
than the marriage to that human male?

34:18.120 --> 34:18.920
Xiao Yao,

34:19.480 --> 34:21.370
are you going to destroy all demons

34:21.370 --> 34:23.130
just in order to marry a human?

34:34.510 --> 34:35.960
The Dragon Essence Pearl
of the dragon clan,

34:35.960 --> 34:38.000
formed by primordial dragon spirits,

34:38.000 --> 34:40.060
possesses earth-shattering power.

34:40.480 --> 34:42.280
The Universe Pearl of Ao Hen Clan

34:42.440 --> 34:44.840
carries the power to overturn and reverse.

34:45.440 --> 34:47.230
The Primordial Pearl of Qiong Qi Clan

34:47.230 --> 34:49.159
has the power of primordial chaos.

34:49.190 --> 34:50.840
The Mist Pearl of vine serpents

34:50.840 --> 34:52.969
contains the power to track and trace.

34:53.280 --> 34:55.150
The Earth Pearl of the Mountain Demon Clan

34:55.150 --> 34:58.120
has the natural power to nurture lives.

34:58.280 --> 34:59.880
The Thunder Pearl of the Lightning Clan

34:59.880 --> 35:01.480
can release power of suppression.

35:01.480 --> 35:03.150
The Wind Calming Pearl of Bi Fang Clan

35:03.150 --> 35:05.360
possesses the power
to dissipate fog and haze.

35:05.360 --> 35:06.960
The Celestial Pearl of the Fox Clan

35:06.960 --> 35:08.630
consists of the power of yin and yang.

35:08.630 --> 35:10.760
All the eight pearls are gathered now.

35:10.920 --> 35:14.360
We humans' aspiration to gain strength
is manifested to heaven and earth.

35:14.360 --> 35:16.190
Humans should not be exterminated.

35:16.190 --> 35:18.070
We beseech you, deities, to reveal

35:18.070 --> 35:20.330
the celestial mountain and Yuli Spring!

35:57.630 --> 35:58.340
This...

35:58.510 --> 35:59.230
What's going on?

35:59.230 --> 36:00.030
It's an unusual phenomenon.

36:00.030 --> 36:00.590
Why would this happen?

36:00.590 --> 36:01.050
This...

36:01.550 --> 36:02.070
This scene...

36:02.070 --> 36:03.360
What caused this unusual phenomenon?

36:03.360 --> 36:04.080
Yeah.

36:04.230 --> 36:05.630
Something must be wrong.

36:05.710 --> 36:06.370
This is bad.

36:07.190 --> 36:08.520
Dragon Lord, watch out!

36:09.110 --> 36:10.510
Dragon Lord, be careful!

36:13.440 --> 36:14.070
Long Zhi!

36:17.710 --> 36:19.590
Dragon Lord, don't bother.

36:20.230 --> 36:21.920
I've failed to pass the tribulation.

36:21.920 --> 36:23.400
No one can save me now.

36:25.190 --> 36:26.480
With the protection of dragon ancestors,

36:26.480 --> 36:27.340
you'll be fine.

36:28.510 --> 36:29.920
I did too much evil.

36:31.030 --> 36:33.290
The ancestors won't protect me anymore.

36:35.000 --> 36:37.060
In fact, I already had a hunch long ago

36:37.760 --> 36:39.820
that I couldn't overcome this tribulation.

36:39.820 --> 36:42.680
I shouldn't have wasted
that golden armor of yours.

36:44.110 --> 36:46.210
It's nothing compared to your life.

36:46.490 --> 36:47.890
I only want you to be well.

36:49.680 --> 36:50.670
Xiao Yao...

36:52.720 --> 36:54.060
Actually, I've been

36:55.280 --> 36:56.740
keeping a secret from you.

36:58.480 --> 36:59.080
What is it?

36:59.790 --> 37:01.580
I once slaughtered humans

37:03.030 --> 37:04.730
in the name of Ao Hen.

37:07.960 --> 37:10.690
As you finally transformed
into an Azure Dragon,

37:10.880 --> 37:13.560
you fell deeply in love with a human.

37:14.570 --> 37:16.500
I tried to dissuade you many times,

37:16.700 --> 37:18.480
yet instead of taking my advice,

37:18.480 --> 37:20.740
you became increasingly devoted to him.

37:21.470 --> 37:24.210
It pained me to see you
persist in this mistake,

37:25.510 --> 37:27.640
so I sneaked into the human clan

37:28.110 --> 37:29.770
with an attempt to kill Hong Ye

37:30.760 --> 37:32.230
in Ao Hen's name.

38:13.480 --> 38:15.340
We humans have never had anything

38:15.510 --> 38:17.170
to do with Ao Hen Clan.

38:17.550 --> 38:19.210
How could you kill people

38:19.360 --> 38:21.050
without cause?

38:21.840 --> 38:23.190
Humans are lowly creatures.

38:23.190 --> 38:25.720
No reason is needed
to exterminate your kind.

39:05.030 --> 39:06.110
Father...

39:13.710 --> 39:14.880
Long Zhi,

39:14.880 --> 39:15.450
you...

39:17.360 --> 39:19.010
I slaughtered the innocent

39:19.320 --> 39:21.110
and thus lost heaven's blessing

39:21.110 --> 39:23.110
and failed to pass the tribulation.

39:24.000 --> 39:25.550
But I have no regrets.

39:26.630 --> 39:28.030
Dragons are noble beings

39:28.710 --> 39:31.030
that must never be dragged down by humans.

39:31.030 --> 39:33.170
But humans won't remain weak forever.

39:33.280 --> 39:35.570
Then it's all the more reason
to prevent them from using

39:35.570 --> 39:38.030
an Azure Dragon's power
to find Yuli Spring.

39:38.710 --> 39:41.110
Humans have long been oppressed by demons.

39:42.960 --> 39:44.990
Should they achieve immortality,

39:46.030 --> 39:48.360
they will definitely provoke conflicts.

39:51.900 --> 39:52.620
Long Zhi.

39:56.150 --> 39:57.230
Did you also slaughter

39:57.230 --> 39:58.760
mountain demons
and those of the Lightning Clan

39:58.760 --> 39:59.360
and the Fox Clan?

39:59.360 --> 40:00.070
No.

40:00.630 --> 40:01.930
I didn't do any of that.

40:04.150 --> 40:05.070
Xiao Yao,

40:06.500 --> 40:08.070
hate me all you want.

40:10.110 --> 40:11.910
But you must remember one thing:

40:13.030 --> 40:15.290
no tribulation can be harder to overcome

40:16.160 --> 40:17.820
than the tribulation of love.

40:19.440 --> 40:21.900
If you devote all your heart
to Hong Ye alone,

40:23.210 --> 40:24.550
there will be a day

40:25.920 --> 40:27.810
when dragons turn against you.

40:32.840 --> 40:33.550
Long Zhi.

40:34.360 --> 40:35.030
Long Zhi!

40:45.110 --> 40:45.960
Long Zhi!
